      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        614.356201171875,
        522.320556640625,
        628.7991943359375
      ],
      "text": "an intensive phase and a continuation phase, simplifying the delivery and monitoring of treatment.",
