        665.2332763671875,
        527.5611572265625,
        679.67626953125
      ],
      "text": "Patients who receive the (H)REZ–levofloxacin regimen need to be monitored during treatment, using",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.997249603271484,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
