      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        704.8333129882812,
        527.622314453125,
        719.2763061523438
      ],
      "text": "followed up with DST for rifampicin resistance and, if possible, for fluoroquinolones and pyrazinamide.",
